# Data Fetching

## Camadas

| Camada | Local |
|--------|-------|
| BFF client | `services/bff/*.bff.ts` |
| Query keys | `services/queries/query-keys.ts` |
| Queries | `services/queries/*.queries.ts` |
| Mutations | `services/queries/*.mutations.ts` |
| Commands | `features/*/hooks/use*Command.ts` |

## Proibido

- `fetch` ou `axios` dentro de componentes
- Cache manual fora do TanStack Query

## Padrões

- Invalidar queries após mutations
- `staleTime` default em `lib/cache/query-config.ts`
- Optimistic updates apenas quando fizer sentido
